supralinux-drivers (1.0.1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Fix PackageKit transactions: PkTask has no "error" signal. The bogus
    connection raised before refresh/apply started and left the UI busy
    forever. Errors are now reported by generic_finish().
  * Pass tuple user_data to PackageKit async callbacks; None raised
    "expected tuple for callback user_data" on every progress event.

